%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-language-introduction (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  {
    size: 1,
    person: {
      name: "Yoda"
    }
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload application/json
{
    "size" : 1,
    "person": {
      "name": "Yoda"
    }
}
%%% output application/dw
{
  size: 1,
  person: {
    name: "Yoda"
  }
} as Object {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "application/json"}
